{"day":"2027-03-01","number":143,"rounds":[{"facts":[{"text":"For the 1956 wedding anniversary of Johnny Jordaan, the king of the Jordaanlied, 30,000 people showed up.","sources":[{"title":"Johnny Jordaan","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Johnny_Jordaan"},{"title":"Jordaanlied","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jordaanlied"}]},{"text":"The wasp Anoplius viaticus caches a paralysed spider for its offspring to feed on.","sources":[{"title":"Anoplius viaticus","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anoplius_viaticus"},{"title":"Hoarding (animal behavior)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hoarding_(animal_behavior)"}]},{"text":"The 1984 general election in Gibraltar came to be known as the \"dockyard election\".","sources":[{"title":"1984 Gibraltar general election","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1984_Gibraltar_general_election"},{"title":"Gibraltar","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gibraltar"}]},{"text":"The Crimean Khanate was annexed by the Russian Empire on 4 April 1783.","sources":[{"title":"Crimean Khanate","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Crimean_Khanate"},{"title":"1783 Russian annexation of Crimea","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1783_Russian_annexation_of_Crimea"},{"title":"Russian Empire","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Russian_Empire"}]},{"text":"Mimoun Ben Ali, a left-handed Spanish boxer of Moroccan descent, was a three-time European champion.","sources":[{"title":"Mimoun Ben Ali","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mimoun_Ben_Ali"}]}],"fake":3,"original":"The Crimean Khanate was annexed by the Russian Empire on 19 April 1783.","change":{"kind":"count","old":"19","new":"4","start":57,"end":59},"difficulty":0.032,"nli":0.9942,"fact_ids":["11a35cf841fa","f000ef234447","f6f23b4ccaa1","0e8769be8824","bafcf1106d69"]},{"facts":[{"text":"Manuel Belgrano handed the command of the Army of the North to José de San Martín in 1789.","sources":[{"title":"Manuel Belgrano","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manuel_Belgrano"},{"title":"